ote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(20年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"78.3\" width=\"320\" height=\"6.299999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,12.8 9.1,22.8 14.2,26.6 19.3,25.4 24.5,31.7 29.6,24.1 34.7,30.4 39.8,30.4 44.9,30.4 50.0,25.4 55.1,26.6 60.3,20.3 65.4,26.6 70.5,43.0 75.6,48.1 80.7,55.6 85.8,53.1 91.0,50.6 96.1,43.0 101.2,36.7 106.3,45.5 111.4,45.5 116.5,48.1 121.6,51.8 126.8,50.6 131.9,53.1 137.0,58.2 142.1,60.7 147.2,56.9 152.3,63.2 157.4,65.7 162.6,61.9 167.7,61.9 172.8,58.2 177.9,60.7 183.0,58.2 188.1,64.5 193.2,64.5 198.4,68.2 203.5,73.3 208.6,74.5 213.7,75.8 218.8,77.1 223.9,80.8 229.0,89.7 234.2,90.9 239.3,97.2 244.4,90.9 249.5,89.7 254.6,87.2 259.7,93.5 264.9,93.5 270.0,96.0 275.1,94.7 280.2,87.2 285.3,93.5 290.4,88.4 295.5,89.7 300.7,89.7 305.8,88.4 310.9,89.7 316.0,84.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 198.4 80.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"84.6\" r=\"4\" fi